### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/health


### Create Analysis Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/analysis/7635bd23-ced9-4f6f-9fae-afe52625d699/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "b6a6671c-f04c-47f8-a4d3-11374f0d75cb",
  "urgent": false,
  "photos": ["photo1base64", "photo2base64"]
}


### Create Urgent Analysis Request
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/analysis/7635bd23-ced9-4f6f-9fae-afe52625d699/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "b6a6671c-f04c-47f8-a4d3-11374f0d75cb",
  "urgent": true,
  "photos": ["photo1base64"]
}


### Create Request - Invalid customer_id (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/analysis/not-a-uuid/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "b6a6671c-f04c-47f8-a4d3-11374f0d75cb",
  "urgent": false,
  "photos": []
}


