### List Analysis Requests (expect 200 with array)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/analysis/7635bd23-ced9-4f6f-9fae-afe52625d699/requests

### List Analysis Requests - Unknown customer (expect 200 with empty array)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/analysis/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/requests

### List Analysis Requests - Invalid customer_id (expect 400)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/analysis/not-a-uuid/requests